  "description": "⭐ <em>Your brunch plans just got buffer. </em><strong><em>Buff Bingo Drag Brunch</em></strong><em> in London serves up boys, balls, bottomless booze, and fabulous drag queens every week.&nbsp;</em><br><br><strong>Highlights</strong><br> 👑 High-energy, hilarious drag shows&nbsp;<br> 🍔 A delicious brunch dish of your choice. Choose from an array of international street food vendors (see menu <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vSggFlyMTEcJNnEAe0nLh97SP0aj9idBhBi5UASZ1cqrQaHpSGe4GQ8DX25DdOui2F_vT6hMkgW5O4a/pub\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a>)<br> 🥂 90 minutes of bottomless Prosecco, cocktails (rum punch &amp; vodka woo woos), beer &amp; cider, softs - Coke, Diet Coke, Sprite Zero or Heineken 00<br> 🤩 Gorgeous buff butler service (will you win a lap dance?!)<br> 🎁 Bingo, games and prizes worth up to £200 to be won<br> 🎵 DJ sets and dancing all afternoon<br><br> 💡 <strong>Feeling extra adventurous?</strong> Take your brunch vibes up on the roof this summer at our <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/612734\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>Buff Bingo Summer Rooftop Drag Bottomless Brunch – London</strong></a> for sun, fun, and even more outrageous bingo action!<br>🎄Get into the festive spirit! Dates <strong>from 28th November to 19th December will be Christmas-themed, </strong>with a special festive twist on the Buff Bingo experience<br><br><strong>General Info</strong><br> 📅 Dates and times: select your date &amp; time directly in the ticket selector<br> 🕒 Running schedule:<br><ul><li>1:00 PM - Doors open &amp; bar ready</li><li>2:00 PM - 3:30 PM – Bottomless drinks served</li><li>2:00 PM - Bingo begins!</li><li>5:00 PM - Brunch wraps up (but the memories last forever!)</li></ul><strong>🕒<em> December 3rd, 4th, 10th and 11th sessions run from 2 p.m. to 6 p.m., with the same time intervals&nbsp;</em></strong><br> ⏳ Duration: 4 hours&nbsp;<br> 📍 Venue: Vauxhall Arches - Fire &amp; The Garden<br> 👤 Age requirement: 18+ with valid ID<br> ♿ Accessibility: the venue is wheelchair accessible&nbsp;&nbsp;<br> 🥳 Special celebrations: get a complimentary celebratory welcome cocktail for the star of your party (hen/stag/birthdays). After booking, please see your confirmation email for full details on how to claim your cocktail. Want to make your special person feel even more special? Book a personalised shout-out or fun-pass add-on. Details of how to book on your confirmation email<br> 🍴 Food orders: please view the menu <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vSggFlyMTEcJNnEAe0nLh97SP0aj9idBhBi5UASZ1cqrQaHpSGe4GQ8DX25DdOui2F_vT6hMkgW5O4a/pub\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a>.<br> ❗ Please see the Terms and Conditions of this experience <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vRVh_O4prrsvgffVEh-dCQFygR29rDSef88CG4YXsMc07ZWEnU_YPc0k69Pov-Awcq4of9Qenecs8V4/pub\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br> ❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://buffbingo.uk/#faqs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br><br><strong>Description</strong><br> If your idea of brunch involves dancing on your chair, shouting at bingo cards, and being served by buff butlers, you’re in the right place. <em>Buff Bingo Drag Brunch</em> is pure, unfiltered fun—a daytime party that doesn’t hold back. Go big with the full bottomless brunch experience or just come along for the brunch and the show. Whether it’s a hen do, birthday, or just a well-earned blowout, this is your excuse to let loose, laugh loud, and maybe even win big. Get your tickets for <em>Buff Bingo Drag Brunch</em> in London!<br>",
